ドジで天然でおっちょこちょいだけど、全く気にしないのが私（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自慢ですはい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、花火大会とか行ったことないなあ。行ってみたいなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの夜空に散るでっかい花火を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目の前で見られたら、キレイなんだろうなあ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問にこたえるよ(ミ＾o＾ミ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼  Name :  仙台のまーくん さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎  京都みたいにのど自慢やるとしたら、さゆちゃんなら何歌う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  うーん、aikoさんとか家入レオさんとかかなあ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼  Name :  フジキセキ  さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎  もうすぐ夏だけど、さゆは海すきですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  埼玉県民だから、海には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"憧れと、少し抵抗がある（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼  Name :  あべちゃん  さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎  さゆは夏休みの嫌な思い出なんかあったりする？？ 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  吹奏楽部の夏コンがあるから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっと部活で、遊んだりお祭り行ったり一切出来なかったし、練習きつかったー(´^ω^`;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、習い事の合宿で、女子しかいない習い事だったから楽しかったんだけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隣の部屋の先輩が「怖い話しようよ!」って言ってきて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖いのがめちゃめちゃ苦手な私（当時小3）は、「せ、先輩...トイレに行ってきます!」って言って逃げたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆に一人でトイレ行くほうが怖くて後悔。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、戻ってきたら私の部屋の先輩が泣いてたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一体、どんな恐ろしいことがおこったんだー:(；゛゜'ω゜'):"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってガクブルした思い出（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"休憩中に、きいちゃん、ろってぃー、ゆったんの生誕祭もありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとうo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、れなりんの卒業セレモニーもありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約三年間、お疲れさま。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、有難うね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学業もお仕事も、大変なのによく頑張ってたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりんの、明るくて元気なとこ、時々ちょこっと抜けてること、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな大好きですo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりんと一番思い出が深いのは、4枚目。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポジションも隣で、ユニット曲もペアになることが多かったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうれなりんと一緒に歌えなくなっちゃうの悲しい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年のバースデーライブはもうれなりんとのペアは無いんだなあ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり、寂しいな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、これからも、お互い夢に向かって頑張ろうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":